# Security Features Guide

Security is a core part of this project, with key practices including:

- JWT-based authentication with access and refresh tokens (see [server/api/auth/login.post.js](mdc:server/api/auth/login.post.js))
- HTTP-only, Secure, SameSite cookies for token storage
- Passwords hashed with SHA-256
- Role-based access control
- Audit logging of user actions ([prisma/schema.prisma](mdc:prisma/schema.prisma))
- Nuxt Security module enabled in [nuxt.config.js](mdc:nuxt.config.js)

Review the Nuxt config and authentication endpoints for implementation details.
